      <description><![CDATA[
            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261004/202610042322553775.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261004/202610042322553775_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261004/202610042322553775_720.jpg"> </div><p>【比赛战报】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-05/match1949571date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">4连胜！十人葡萄牙2-1挪威锁定淘汰赛 拉莫斯4场3球坎塞洛世界波</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.61" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261005/zhanbao_image_1949571_1791146698_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.61" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.61" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261005/zhanbao_image_1949571_1791146698_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261005/zhanbao_image_1949571_1791146698_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>葡萄牙主场2-1逆转挪威，葡萄牙取得欧国联4连胜提前出线锁定淘汰赛资格，挪威遭遇3连败。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-05/match1949569date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">德国0-0希腊4轮仅1胜 伯卡特进球被吹舍汉特、特雷乌失良机</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.68" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261005/zhanbao_image_1949569_1791146373_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.68" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.68" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261005/zhanbao_image_1949569_1791146373_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261005/zhanbao_image_1949569_1791146373_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>德国0-0战平希腊，本场伯卡特进球被吹，舍汉特、特雷乌失良机，德国4场仅1胜。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-05/match1949570date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">4轮不败！荷兰2-1塞尔维亚 库普梅纳斯破门齐尔克泽替补制胜</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261005/zhanbao_image_1949570_1791146399_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261005/zhanbao_image_1949570_1791146399_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261005/zhanbao_image_1949570_1791146399_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>荷兰队以2-1击败塞尔维亚，库普梅纳斯破门，齐尔克泽替补制胜。哈维上任后4场不败。</p><p>【国家队大门对C罗敞开】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-05/6ac2c0a36b30cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">热苏斯：C罗必须决定自己的未来，这只是误会，我认为很容易解决</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261005/6ac2c12073945_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261005/6ac2c12073945_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261005/6ac2c12073945_720.jpg"> </div><p>球报消息，在葡萄牙2-1击败挪威赛后，葡萄牙主帅热苏斯接受采访。他表示对于C罗未来重返国家队一事，一切可能性都仍然存在。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-05/6ac2c971b1ac6native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">热苏斯：对我来说还会征召C罗，只要他想重返国家队就可以被征召</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-05/6ac2c7c99ea24native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">热苏斯：没有决定C罗未来的权力 我和他在职业层面的友谊非常深厚</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-05/6ac2cc5340fb7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">热苏斯：和B费想法一样；告诉过C罗他不能输球哭着结束国家队生涯</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-05/6ac2ce930b3banative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">热苏斯：和C罗的事情被过度放大但实际没有问题 不会向任何人道歉</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.73" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261005/202610050548569414.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.73" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.73" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261005/202610050548569414_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261005/202610050548569414_720.jpg"> </div><p>葡萄牙vs挪威赛后，热苏斯出席新闻发布会，其中，他再次详细回应了C罗的话题。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-05/6ac2c15100121native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">门德斯：我们是一个团结的集体，C罗或任何人回来时都会受到欢迎</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/6a32e939b71a3.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/6a32e939b71a3.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/6a32e939b71a3.jpg"> </div><p>欧国联比赛，葡萄牙2-1击败挪威。赛后，努诺·门德斯接受Sport TV采访，其中他谈到了C罗的话题。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-05/6ac2c1d472011native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">C罗回归？坎塞洛：这得由主帅和足协主席决定 C罗是我们的队长</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261005/6ac2c133c0f84_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261005/6ac2c133c0f84.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261005/6ac2c133c0f84.jpg"> </div><p>葡萄牙2-1战胜挪威提前两轮出线，坎塞洛赛后接受了采访。他表示C罗是他们的队长，但是否回归，要看教练和管理层的决定。</p><p>【其他新闻】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-05/6ac284b48c015native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">葡媒：目前没有关于C罗告别赛的谈判，葡足协今晚赛后将寻求和解</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/6abdb8ccdbef0_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/6abdb8ccdbef0.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/6abdb8ccdbef0.jpg"> </div><p>《记录报》报道，在与若热·热苏斯产生矛盾之后，C罗在葡萄牙国家队的未来依旧悬而未决，一切要看今晚巨龙球场对阵挪威的比赛结束后各方所采取的行动。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-05/6ac279f25316bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">葡萄牙经济部长：C罗对国家品牌有巨大影响 很多人靠他才了解我们</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.46" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/6abd918bd0c95.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.46" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.46" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/6abd918bd0c95.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/6abd918bd0c95.jpg"> </div><p>Foot mercato消息，C罗近期的退出集训风波，除了竞技层面外，也是一场带来经济后果的震荡，这促使葡萄牙经济与领土凝聚力部长曼努埃尔·卡斯特罗·阿尔梅达就此表态。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-05/6ac2aad12fe08native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">已抵达沙特！乔治娜社媒晒照，C罗在飞机上陪伴孩子们</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261005/202610050337182991_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261005/202610050337182991_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261005/202610050337182991_720.jpg"> </div><p>乔治娜更新社媒，晒出了C罗与家人们在飞机上的照片。记录报确认，C罗一家人已经抵达沙特。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-05/6ac2bb4c917f5native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">球报：热苏斯希望11月再次征召C罗，他不想成为导致C罗退队的人</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.42" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/6abd7a31be92e.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.42" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.42" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/6abd7a31be92e.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/6abd7a31be92e.jpg"> </div><p>球报消息，热苏斯对于接下来该如何对待C罗，已经有了明确的态度。他希望最晚在11月的国家队比赛日解决这个问题。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-05/6ac2b3ce28530native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">开季7场0球0助！土媒：加拉塔萨雷高层将约谈萨内 要求他提高表现</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260915/6aa8b57f32dbd.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260915/6aa8b57f32dbd.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260915/6aa8b57f32dbd.jpg"> </div><p>土耳其媒体Fanatik消息，萨内新赛季表现低迷，这一情况已经引起了加拉塔萨雷管理层的担忧。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-05/6ac27b30de02cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">皮亚尼奇谈前队友：梅西最强 简直无解；C罗对于进球永不言弃</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/202610011714429777.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/202610011714429777_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/202610011714429777_720.jpg"> </div><p>皮亚尼奇近日接受采访时，他谈到了梅西、C罗的话题，球员时代皮亚尼奇分别与C罗和梅西做过队友，他还聊到了罗马、尤文两支老东家。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-05/6ac2c4b4c4e40native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">心情不错！梅西一身休闲装抵达训练基地，戴墨镜面露笑容</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261005/202610050536328780_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261005/202610050536328780_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261005/202610050536328780_720.jpg"> </div><p>梅西抵达阿根廷训练基地，将参加今天的训练备战自己的告别赛。梅西一身休闲装抵达基地，戴着墨镜，看起来心情不错。</p><a href="http://m.zhibo8.cc/topic/index.html?id=165" class="hide" style="     background: url('http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_200905/zt_4221599266620.png') no-repeat;     background-size: cover;     display: block;     height: 150px;     max-width: 690px;     color: white;     margin: 24px auto;     position: relative;     border-radius: 10px;     overflow: hidden; ">     <div